Ensure one canonical local reply draft exists for the message's conversation

Usage: mxr drafts reply [OPTIONS] <MESSAGE_ID>

Arguments:
  <MESSAGE_ID>

Options:
      --all
      --single
      --dry-run  Preview the selected or newly prepared draft without saving it
  -h, --help     Print help
